; HF-D1 reproducer: each `spawn` body gets a fresh instruction budget.
; Expected: the run's --max-instructions bounds all work, as it does when the
; same 500 loop iterations run sequentially (that variant fails at 1500).
; Observed on 9c739c9 and 41d56ce: all five children finish under
; --max-instructions 1500. Run: howlframe run --max-instructions 1500 --allow-caps process
(cli_app
  (do
    (for i (range 0 5)
      (spawn (lambda ()
        (let (n 0)
          (do
            (while (< n 100) (set n (+ n 1)))
            (print "child finished loop" n))))))
    (sleep 1500)
    (print "main done")))
